{"page":26,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:170","surah":2,"ayah":170,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ ٱتَّبِعُوا۟ مَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ قَالُوا۟ بَلْ نَتَّبِعُ مَآ أَلْفَيْنَا عَلَيْهِ ءَابَآءَنَآ ۗ أَوَلَوْ كَانَ ءَابَآؤُهُمْ لَا يَعْقِلُونَ شَيْـًٔا وَلَا يَهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But when it is said to them, ‘Follow the message that God has sent down,’ they answer, ‘We follow the ways of our fathers.’ What! Even though their fathers understood nothing and were not guided?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قِيلَ","en_gloss":"it is said","transliteration":"qīla","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱتَّبِعُوا۟","en_gloss":"Follow","transliteration":"ittabiʿū","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"has revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":10,"ar":"نَتَّبِعُ","en_gloss":"we follow","transliteration":"nattabiʿu","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَلْفَيْنَا","en_gloss":"we found","transliteration":"alfaynā","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"[on it]","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ءَابَآءَنَآ ۗ","en_gloss":"our forefathers (following)","transliteration":"ābāanā","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَوَلَوْ","en_gloss":"Even though","transliteration":"awalaw","verse_key":"2:170"},{"pos":16,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"[were]","transliteration":"kāna"