كُلُونَ فِى بُطُونِهِمْ إِلَّا ٱلنَّارَ وَلَا يُكَلِّمُهُمُ ٱللَّهُ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ وَلَا يُزَكِّيهِمْ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who conceal the Scripture that God sent down and sell it for a small price, they only fill their bellies with Fire. God will not speak to them on the Day of Resurrection, nor will He purify them: an agonizing torment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَكْتُمُونَ","en_gloss":"conceal","transliteration":"yaktumūna","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"(has) revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah (has)","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيَشْتَرُونَ","en_gloss":"and they purchase","transliteration":"wayashtarūna","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"there with","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ثَمَنًۭا","en_gloss":"a gain","transliteration":"thamanan","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَلِيلًا ۙ","en_gloss":"little","transliteration":"qalīlan","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَأْكُلُونَ","en_gloss":"they eat","transliteration":"yakulūna","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:174"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بُطُونِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their bellies","transliterati